<%# SALES-5 — 수수료 정산 목록(연월 필터). pending은 하이라이트, mark paid는 상태 전이라
    member PATCH. 지급 이체·원천징수(3.3%)는 오프라인 — 이 화면은 상태 기록만 담당(Q24). %>
<div class="admin-title">수수료 정산</div>

<div class="admin-card mb-4">
  <%= form_with url: admin_sales_commissions_path, method: :get, class: "flex items-end gap-3" do |form| %>
    <div>
      <%= form.label :year, "연도", class: "admin-label" %>
      <%= form.number_field :year, value: @year, min: 2000, max: 2100, class: "admin-input", style: "width:7rem;" %>
    </div>
    <div>
      <%= form.label :month, "월(비우면 연간)", class: "admin-label" %>
      <%= form.number_field :month, value: @month, min: 1, max: 12, class: "admin-input", style: "width:6rem;" %>
    </div>
    <%= form.submit "조회", class: "admin-btn", style: "width:auto;margin-top:0;" %>
  <% end %>
  <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[#6b6b66]">
    지급 예정(pending) 합계 <b class="text-orange-700 tabular-nums"><%= number_with_delimiter(@pending_total) %>원</b> ·
    지급 완료 합계 <b class="text-green-700 tabular-nums"><%= number_with_delimiter(@paid_total) %>원</b>
  </p>
</div>

<div class="admin-card overflow-x-auto p-0">
  <table class="w-full min-w-[720px] text-left text-sm">
    <caption class="sr-only">연월별 수수료 정산 스냅샷</caption>
    <thead>
      <tr class="border-b border-[#e2e2df] text-xs font-semibold text-[#6b6b66]">
        <th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3">정산월</th>
        <th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3">영업 직원</th>
        <th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3">기준 결제액</th>
        <th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3">요율</th>
        <th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3">수수료</th>
        <th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3">상태</th>
        <th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3">처리</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <% @commissions.each do |commission| %>
        <tr class="border-b border-[#ecece8] last:border-0">
          <th scope="row" class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold tabular-nums"><%= commission.period_label %></th>
          <td class="px-4 py-3">
            <%= commission.sales_rep.name %>
            <span class="text-xs text-[#6b6b66]">(<%= commission.sales_rep.sales? ? "영업" : "감투" %>)</span>
          </td>
          <td class="px-4 py-3 tabular-nums"><%= number_with_delimiter(commission.base_amount) %>원</td>
          <td class="px-4 py-3 tabular-nums"><%= commission.rate %>%</td>
          <td class="px-4 py-3 font-bold tabular-nums"><%= number_with_delimiter(commission.amount) %>원</td>
          <td class="px-4 py-3">
            <% if commission.pending? %>
              <span class="rounded-full bg-orange-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-orange-700">지급 예정</span>
            <% else %>
              <span class="rounded-full bg-green-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-green-700">지급 완료</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-[#6b6b66]"><%= commission.paid_at&.strftime("%m-%d %H:%M") %></span>
            <% end %>
          </td>
          <td class="px-4 py-3">
            <% if commission.pending? %>
              <%= button_to "지급 처리", mark_paid_admin_sales_commission_path(commission), method: :patch,
                    class: "rounded-lg bg-[#1e4d3b] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-white hover:bg-[#173d2f]" %>
            <% end %>
          </td>
        </tr>
      <% end %>
      <% if @commissions.empty? %>
        <tr><td colspan="7" class="px-4 py-8 text-center text-sm text-[#6b6b66]">
          해당 기간의 정산 스냅샷이 없습니다(매월 1일 00:05 KST 자동 집계 — SALES-5).
        </td></tr>
      <% end %>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>
